The '''Winter Island''' is a [[Spawnable Island]] obtainable from [[Gifts]]. 

== Obtaining ==
A '''Winter Island''' has a {{Chance|0.10%|1|969.12|gifts}} chance to be obtained from a {{Item|Red Gift}}. Both the donating and receiving [[player]] get the item.

== Usage ==
Placing '''Winter Island''' creates an Island composed of {{Item|Stone}}, {{Item|Dirt}}, {{Item|Snow Block}}s, {{Item|Packed Ice}}, {{Item|Spruce Log}}, {{Item|Spruce Leaves}}, {{Item|Spruce Fence}}s, and {{Item|Ice}}. 

It also contains a {{Item|Winter Crystal}}, which increases the speed of all {{Item|Snow Minion}}s and {{Item|Ice Minion}}s on the [[Private Island]] by {{Green|5%}}, and spawns a [[Gift]] ({{Item Display|White Gift!White}}, {{Item Display|Green Gift!Green}} or {{Item Display|Red Gift!Red}}) once every [[SkyBlock Year]] in a {{Green|15}} block radius. 

== Trivia ==
*This item shares the same name as the [[Winter Island]], where {{zone|Jerry's Workshop}} is located.

